# 🚀 Arcanova AI - Quick Start Guide

## ⚡ 5-Minute Setup

## Google Colab (Tesla T4, No API Keys)

1. In Colab, set Runtime -> Change runtime type -> GPU (Tesla T4).
2. Clone your repo and install dependencies.
3. Launch Streamlit from terminal.

```bash
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/arcanova-ai
cd arcanova-ai
python -m pip install --upgrade pip
pip install -r requirements.txt

# Optional: lower VRAM usage for T4
export PYTORCH_CUDA_ALLOC_CONF=expandable_segments:True

streamlit run app.py --server.port 8501 --server.address 0.0.0.0
```

No API keys are required. The app loads local Hugging Face model weights directly.

