### 1️⃣ **Windows Users** (Easiest)

```bash
# Download and run arcanova.exe
# That's it! The app handles everything.
```

### 2️⃣ **Developers** (Git + Python)

```bash
# Clone repository
git clone https://github.com/yourusername/arcanova-ai
cd arcanova-ai

# Create virtual environment
python -m venv venv
venv\Scripts\activate  # Windows
# source venv/bin/activate  # Mac/Linux

# Install dependencies
python install_dependencies.py --gpu  # For NVIDIA GPU
# OR
python install_dependencies.py --cpu  # For CPU only

# Run app
streamlit run app.py
```

App opens at: `http://localhost:8501`

